<title>UK: Sweden sets 20 bln yen Feb 2000 dual-currency bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets 20 bln yen Feb 2000 dual-currency bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by sole lead manager Wako International (Europe) Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDEN</p>
<p> AMT    20 BLN YEN    COUPON     5.80	MATURITY    28.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE   DUAL-CURRENCY ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    26.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.60	LISTING    NONE</p>
<p> NOTES	REDEMPTION IN AUSTRALIAN DOLLARS</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
